{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T13:59:10.876Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7b0e58428f53e3aaeaafb372","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-stq61b","lineage:pm-stq61b","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-stq61b","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-stq61b","lineage:pm-stq61b","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-30T13:59:10.876Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation evidence: resolveUnknownOptionRetry now treats a rejected option containing whitespace as a dash-leading value, never an option spelling. It skips the lexical drop fallback and offers a retry only when every later token is itself an option. That retry moves the value behind a -- separator and strips global bootstrap tokens from the part before it, because stripGlobalBootstrapTokens stops at --. Otherwise no retry is advertised. The refusal replaces the declared-nowhere option advice with an explanation of how to pass the value. Verified in an isolated tracker: pm close <id> \"--unset is now a list\" advertises pm close <id> -- \"--unset is now a list\", and replaying it stores that close_reason. pm comments <id> \"--flag style comment text\" replays as pm item comments <id> -- \"...\" and stores the comment. pm create \"--weird title\" --type Task gets the explanation and no lossy retry. Negative control: with only error-guidance.ts reverted, the 5 new unit cases fail (5 failed, 9 passed). With the fix, tests/unit/cli 843/843 pass, the refusal-closure gate has no findings, and ESLint passes. escape_class review_caught_late: the defect was found by this session while closing pm-gh1633, not by a user report."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T13:59:10.876Z"}],"before_hash":"a654968bde78ba578675fd732fb1a401a0e8f316dce185de7b939e9bac6f4efd","after_hash":"470c93fdbed2537bfc2c86ec497160b3ea9095adef8938b965ddeb81ae49307f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"2192ecebf822cea762351770382f6c586cd9fff3de7741e8ffd5cbf0e817e69a"}
